WEBVTT

00:00:00.256 --> 00:00:03.128
Build one reviewed pipeline for Cluster A.

00:00:03.413 --> 00:00:08.056
Keep each configuration file focused on its named task and confirm the same
intended

00:00:08.107 --> 00:00:09.659
cluster in every file.

00:00:09.777 --> 00:00:14.250
Datacenter and cluster labels help you find files, but they do not select

00:00:14.258 --> 00:00:16.946
a target or map its credentials automatically.

00:00:17.271 --> 00:00:21.914
Use the established sequence: zero one, administrator password when required;

00:00:22.092 --> 00:00:24.452
zero two, EULA and Pulse;

00:00:24.610 --> 00:00:27.183
zero three, data services IP;

00:00:27.340 --> 00:00:29.572
zero four, high availability;

00:00:29.772 --> 00:00:32.068
zero five, rebuild reservation;

00:00:32.204 --> 00:00:34.464
zero six, storage container;

00:00:34.606 --> 00:00:36.987
zero seven, Prism login title;

00:00:37.038 --> 00:00:40.884
and zero eight, register Prism Element to Prism Central.

00:00:41.134 --> 00:00:45.691
After changing an administrator password, verify the replacement login before later

00:00:45.742 --> 00:00:47.835
stages use its credential reference.

00:00:48.024 --> 00:00:51.344
Do not repeat the initial password change in later files.

00:00:51.566 --> 00:00:55.078
Saving changed credentials to ZTF persists their values;

00:00:55.150 --> 00:00:59.750
pipeline submission synchronizes the saved global configuration into the execution

00:00:59.800 --> 00:01:04.138
runtime. ZTF one point x remains the supported executor.

00:01:04.253 --> 00:01:08.255
Check each selected action against its configuration file and obtain the required

00:01:08.306 --> 00:01:11.595
approvals. A failed stage stops later work.

00:01:11.828 --> 00:01:16.172
The running label identifies the configuration step, so several Configure actions

00:01:16.393 --> 00:01:17.793
can still be distinguished.

00:01:18.014 --> 00:01:22.366
If only step zero eight fails during an eligible recovery, resume that

00:01:22.366 --> 00:01:26.820
recovery run. Reconcile PE and PC, confirm registration is

00:01:26.820 --> 00:01:31.293
absent, and provide fresh health evidence before the registration-only retry.

00:01:31.471 --> 00:01:35.525
Successful steps zero one through zero seven stay recorded and are not

00:01:35.525 --> 00:01:36.349
replayed.
